{"articleNo":"82881","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=82881&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 하반기(11기) 아포초등학교 TaLK 내국인장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.09","hit":"3809","attachments":[{"name":"1.아포초등학교 TaLK11기 모집 선발 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82881&attachNo=71504"},{"name":"2. 모집 선발 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82881&attachNo=71517"},{"name":"3. 지원서 및 학습지도안.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82881&attachNo=71774"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">아포초등학교에서는 2013학년도 하반기(11기) 정부초청해외영어봉사장학생(TaLK) 내국인장학생을 모집·선발하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11.9pt\">2013년 하반기(11기) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11.9pt\">정부초청해외영어봉사장학생(TaLK) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\">내국인장학생 모집？선발</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\">아포초등학교 공고 제2013-17호</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -2.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 22.8pt\">공&nbsp; 고&nbsp; 문</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 39.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 모집 영역 및 인원 : 11기 TaLK 내국인장학생 1명</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 39.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 39.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 근무 조건</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -39.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 39.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 활동 기간 : 2013. 09. 01. ∼ 2014. 02. 28.(6개월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -57.3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 57.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 본인이 희망하고 특별한 문제가 없을 경우 6개월씩 최장 2년까지 연장 가능(최우수 평가자에 한해 예외적으로 2년 추가 연장)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -80pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 80pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 강의 시간 및 강사료</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -80pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 80pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 강의 시간 : 주 9시간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -80pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 80pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 강사료 : 시간당 14,000원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -80pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 80pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -80pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 80pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 지원 자격</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 지역에 대한 사랑과 봉사정신이 투철한 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신체 및 정신이 건강한 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 국내 대학 재학생(휴학생 포함), 졸업생</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 교육대학, 사범대학/교직이수자(영어 전공자) 우대</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 영어로 의사소통이 가능한 자(영어 성적 제출 필) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 평점평균이 3.2/4.5 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. TaLK 오리엔테에션에 참여할 수 있는 자(일정 추후 통보</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2013.7월~8경 국립국제교육원, 도교육청주관 2번 연수 참석)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 지원서 접수</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수기간: ‘13. 05. 06(월) ~ 05. 24(금) ※ 학교 도착분에 한함</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; T